# 小物箱 and 小物の設定 (design 11.2.1, 11.8), for tools/ui_run.py on a kernel built
# with UITEST=1. The box's window stands at 144,124 and its rows at y = 176 + 23i
# (closed links, 19 high, 4 apart).
# The first right press at x,Y opens the menu with 小物管理 at Y+121; after an item
# of it was chosen, with 小物管理 at Y. Its items are at x+130 from there: 一番上へ
# +0, 一つ上へ +20, 一つ下へ +40, 一番下へ +60, the switch of the menu +100.
# ui_accbox_after.steps then looks at the disk this one leaves (--keep-disk).
open 01a0d6d1-08d0-7fbe-b385-b6d0c36f2308
waitwin 小物箱 60
wait 1500
shot ab_open
# The order is the one 小物の設定 brings (R1.300): ユーザ環境設定 0, システム環境設定 1,
# ネットワーク設定 2, ファイル変換 3, 音量ミキサー 4, ソフトウェアキーボード 5, コンソール 6,
# バックアップ 7, 時計 8, ... BeFC 21 (歯車 has no program without GL=1)
accpos clock
want ok 8 23 +
accpos console
want ok 6 23 +
accpos befc
want ok 22 23 +
# コンソール (row 6): 一番下へ
click 200 314 1
wait 600
move 205 400
wait 150
move 205 435
wait 500
move 330 435
wait 150
click 330 495
wait 800
accpos console
want ok 22 23 +
accpos befc
want ok 21 23 +
accpos clock
want ok 7 23 +
shot ab_bottom
# 時計 (row 7): 一つ下へ, then 一つ上へ
click 200 337 1
wait 600
move 205 338
wait 500
move 330 337
wait 150
click 330 377
wait 800
accpos clock
want ok 8 23 +
click 200 360 1
wait 600
move 205 361
wait 500
move 330 360
wait 150
click 330 380
wait 800
accpos clock
want ok 7 23 +
# バックアップ (row 6): 一番上へ
click 200 314 1
wait 600
move 205 315
wait 500
move 330 314
wait 150
click 330 314
wait 800
accpos btron-backup
want ok 0 23 +
# バックアップ: 小物メニューに表示しない; the box says so, and 小物 leaves it out
click 200 176 1
wait 600
move 205 177
wait 500
move 330 176
wait 150
shot ab_sub
click 330 276
wait 800
accpos btron-backup
want ok 0 23 -
shot ab_hidden
click 600 300 1
wait 600
move 605 301
wait 150
move 605 420
wait 600
shot ab_menu
key 29
wait 300
key 29
wait 300
# 時計 (row 7) carried and let go just above the middle of row 2: before システム環境設定
accpos clock
want ok 7 23 +
drag 200 337 200 215
wait 800
accpos clock
want ok 2 23 +
accpos tessronos-sysenv
want ok 3 23 +
accpos tessronos-userenv
want ok 1 23 +
shot ab_drag
# a package (.tpk) installed: there at once, at the end, the window made again
mkpkg
want ok 0
proginst 01a0d8c4-5500-7f03-8b12-3c4d5e6f7b72
want ok 0
wait 800
accpos ut-acc
want ok 23 24 +
refs 01a0d8c4-5500-7f04-8b12-3c4d5e6f7b73
want ok 1
shot ab_installed
# the same version again: refused before any panel; asked to go ahead: one panel;
# put away: nothing changes
adminpanels
keep panels
proginst 01a0d8c4-5500-7f03-8b12-3c4d5e6f7b72
adminpanels
same panels
proginstq 01a0d8c4-5500-7f03-8b12-3c4d5e6f7b72
wait 1500
progres
want ok -1
shot ab_panel
key 29
wait 1000
progres
adminpanels
accpos ut-acc
want ok 23 24 +
# removed: gone from the box, the menu and the settings, and a 屑実身
progrm 01a0d8c4-5500-7f04-8b12-3c4d5e6f7b73
want ok 0
wait 800
accpos ut-acc
want ok -1 23 -
refs 01a0d8c4-5500-7f04-8b12-3c4d5e6f7b73
want ok 0
open 01a0d6d1-08d6-7896-adb0-7469517f6b4b
waitwin 屑実身操作 30
wait 1000
win 屑実身操作
shot ab_trash
# the package once more over what is in the trash: out of it
proginst 01a0d8c4-5500-7f03-8b12-3c4d5e6f7b72
want ok 0
wait 800
refs 01a0d8c4-5500-7f04-8b12-3c4d5e6f7b73
want ok 1
accpos ut-acc
want ok 23 24 +
# removed, and registered again from the program object itself
progrm 01a0d8c4-5500-7f04-8b12-3c4d5e6f7b73
want ok 0
proginst 01a0d8c4-5500-7f04-8b12-3c4d5e6f7b73
want ok 0
accpos ut-acc
want ok 23 24 +
progrm 01a0d8c4-5500-7f04-8b12-3c4d5e6f7b73
want ok 0
wait 1000
shot ab_trash2
# the desktop's own is not removed
progrm 01a0d6d1-08d1-781f-8f58-35c45aeacef9
want ok -17
# BeFC of the image, whose objects were 削除不可: its menu becomes a 屑実身 with it,
# and both come back when the program object is registered again
progrm 01a0d8c4-5500-7a01-8b12-3c4d5e6f7b50
want ok 0
refs 01a0d8c4-5500-7a01-8b12-3c4d5e6f7b50
want ok 0
refs 01a0d889-5500-7a01-8b12-3c4d5e6f7b52
want ok 0
wait 800
shot ab_trash3
proginst 01a0d8c4-5500-7a01-8b12-3c4d5e6f7b50
want ok 0
refs 01a0d889-5500-7a01-8b12-3c4d5e6f7b52
want ok 1
accpos befc
want ok 22 23 +
wait 800
# 屑実身操作: UT小物, in row 1 (y = 152 + 23i) once the list is made again without
# BeFC and its menu, deleted for good
wait 2000
shot ab_trash4
click 210 175
wait 300
shot ab_trash5
key 4C
wait 1000
shot ab_confirm
key 28
wait 1500
refs 01a0d8c4-5500-7f04-8b12-3c4d5e6f7b73
want ok -1
# installed anew, removed, carried out of the 屑実身 to the BTRON window, saved there,
# and its link's object registered again
proginst 01a0d8c4-5500-7f03-8b12-3c4d5e6f7b72
want ok 0
progrm 01a0d8c4-5500-7f04-8b12-3c4d5e6f7b73
want ok 0
wait 1000
shot ab_trash6
drag 210 175 70 195
wait 1000
shot ab_carried
key 16 01
wait 1500
refs 01a0d8c4-5500-7f04-8b12-3c4d5e6f7b73
want ok 1
proginst 01a0d8c4-5500-7f04-8b12-3c4d5e6f7b73
want ok 0
refs 01a0d8c4-5500-7f04-8b12-3c4d5e6f7b73
want ok 2
accpos ut-acc
want ok 23 24 +
wait 3000
absent !OACV!
